    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow that sounds pretty definitive. but i mean, wasn't the political climate in athens super volatile back then? he was constantly facing exile and death threats. wouldn't you say there was almost no way for him to stay in power without playing both sides at some point just to stay alive?",
