      "content": "idk i'm just wondering if it's fair to judge him by today's standards of \"integrity.\" if you were in his position, with the entire Athenian democracy turning on you and your life literally on the line, would \"maintaining core principles\" even be possible? or is it basically impossible to be a \"principled\" person in that kind of crazy environment?",
